=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play runall --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Run All screen proposed for slice 8,$
# each row's state from the control's real Check, each change$
# the real control's Plan, all of them in one plan on the real$
# plan/apply engine. Which controls hardn.yml asks for, how a$
# row is skipped, and the hostname asked whatever the risk are$
# the gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this$
# machine changes: every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Run All hosts ################################################$
$
  Select a host$
$
   1) Debian 13            The VM's shape$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04         The VM's shape$
   3) Alpine 3.23          The VM's shape$
   4) Fresh                No admin yet$
   5) Hardened             Nothing to change$
   6) Partly done          Some controls done$
   7) Port asked           sshPort 2230$
   8) Proxmox VE 9         Root key-only$
   9) LXC container        DNS, firewall N/A$
  10) Default hardn.yml    Nothing asked$
  11) One refuses          Auto Updates refuses$
  12) Confirm pending      A change waits$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-12 or q]: 4$
$
# Info: runall/fresh$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. Root alone, logged in by$
# key; no ufw, no unattended-upgrades. hardn.yml: george with a$
# key, port 22, two nameservers, backups on, and$
# enableUnattendedUpgrades, enableUfwSshPolicy, configureDns and$
# disableRootSSH true. The design problem: george doesn't exist$
# when root login is planned.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
  [ ] User                 Not Configured Create george, 1 key$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured Refused$
                           - ufw isn't installed. Install it,...$
  [ ] SSH Login            Partial Refused$
                           - You're logged in as root over SS...$
  [ ] SSH Auth             Not Configured Nothing asked$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured Already as asked$
  [+] AppArmor             Configured Status only$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured Turn on$
  [ ] DNS                  Not Configured Set 2 nameservers$
  [+] Backups              Configured Used, not changed$
  [-] Environment          Not Applicable Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Plan, review, confirm$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# Run All hosts ################################################$
$
  Select a host$
$
   1) Debian 13            The VM's shape$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04         The VM's shape$
   3) Alpine 3.23          The VM's shape$
   4) Fresh                No admin yet$
   5) Hardened             Nothing to change$
   6) Partly done          Some controls done$
   7) Port asked           sshPort 2230$
   8) Proxmox VE 9         Root key-only$
   9) LXC container        DNS, firewall N/A$
  10) Default hardn.yml    Nothing asked$
  11) One refuses          Auto Updates refuses$
  12) Confirm pending      A change waits$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-12 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

